---
description: Ban em dashes and related decorative punctuation in all generated text
alwaysApply: true
---

# Prose Style

- Never use Unicode em dashes (U+2014) or en dashes (U+2013) in code, comments, UI copy, docs, commits, PR text, or agent replies.
- Prefer commas, colons, parentheses, or an ASCII hyphen with spaces (` - `).
- For empty/placeholder display values, use ASCII `-` or `N/A`.
